{"id":"592187312","kind":"article","title":"表示不可能的情况","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Representing_impossibilities"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-01-08","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":222,"keywords":["数学证明","反证法","可探索解释","信息可视化"],"summary":"作者提出一个关于可探索解释的设计问题：数学证明常需处理不可能情况，尤其使用反证法时，应如何可靠地将这种情况视觉化呈现？文章没有给出答案，而是将问题链接到有限对象假设等相关讨论。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/592187312","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"oVnIX1zC\">数学中经常需要处理不可能的情况（比如使用反证法证明时）。在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explorable_explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索的解释</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>中，如何可靠地表示这些不可能的情况？</p><p data-pid=\"y1YNZQz4\">如果你要用反证法证明，你必须找个办法来在视觉上呈现不可能的情况！</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"HCBlubib\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Finiteness_assumption_in_explorable_media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索媒介中的有限对象假设</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"p4HtphTV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Finiteness_assumption_in_explorable_media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索媒介的有限对象假设</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Finiteness+assumption+in+explorable+media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"MKLOCcV-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explorable_explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索的解释</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Explorable+explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"GTvbD4Wh\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Representing_impossibilities\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Representing impossibilities</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 可探索的解释 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"598332415\" href=\"#/post/598332415\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 可探索媒介中的有限性假设 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"666393432\" href=\"#/post/666393432\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"591929088","title":"数学社区对于数学家应知应会的知识没有明确标准","author":"Issa Rice","votes":12,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"597533071","title":"对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"666393432","title":"可探索媒介中的有限性假设","author":"Issa Rice","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"598332415","title":"可探索的解释","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}